# bbnix — licensing and provenance

bbnix is a Nix build recipe for a from-source cross-toolchain and userland
targeting BlackBerry 10 / QNX 8 ARM (arm-unknown-nto-qnx8.0.0eabi). It mixes
two licenses. This file states which is which.

