## Not included — the proprietary QNX 8 / BB10 sysroot

bbnix builds *against* the BlackBerry 10 Native SDK target tree
(target_10_3_1_995: C/C++ headers, libc, the prebuilt libstdc++ 4.8.3, CRT
objects). That tree is proprietary and is NOT distributed with bbnix. It is
gitignored and supplied by the user at build time ("bring your own sysroot").
No proprietary bytes enter git. Under the default Model A (impure path) build,
none enter the Nix store either; the alternative Model B (requireFile) ingests
the sysroot into the store as an `unfree`-marked, content-addressed input — by
explicit user choice.

